  "quoteDescription": "Story 20.3 — quote (« devis ») operations, queued by the Bref React Native app (the Flutter V1 test client does not queue them) and read by InvoiceSyncHandler (backend test). A quote is created with CREATE_INVOICE kind QUOTE, edited with UPDATE_INVOICE (optional expectedUpdatedAt: the updatedAt last pulled; stale → REJECTED OPTIMISTIC_LOCK), converted with CONVERT_QUOTE (invoiceId = the id chosen on the device for the new invoice; optional expectedUpdatedAt as for an edit; serverEntityId = that invoice) and cancelled with CANCEL_INVOICE.",
