  "paymentDescription": "Story 20.4 — collection operations (acompte, paiements partiels, échéancier), queued by the Bref React Native app (the Flutter V1 test client does not queue them; it keeps PAY_INVOICE, which now settles the whole invoice) and read by InvoiceSyncHandler (backend test). ADD_INVOICE_PAYMENT: paymentId chosen on the device, amount in XAF francs, exactly one of paidAt (a payment received, yyyy-MM-dd, issued invoice only) or dueDate (a scheduled instalment, draft or issued invoice); replayed with the same content → APPLIED without a second row, same paymentId with another content → REJECTED VALIDATION_ERROR, above what remains due → REJECTED OVERPAYMENT. SETTLE_INVOICE_PAYMENT: the instalment paymentId is paid on paidAt (today when absent), method replaces its own when given; already paid → APPLIED unchanged. serverEntityId = the invoice id.",
