  "termsDescription": "Story 20.5 — document terms on CREATE_INVOICE / UPDATE_INVOICE (invoice or quote), queued by the Bref React Native app (the Flutter V1 test client does not send them; absent = no discount, no delivery, the seller's rate, no due date). discountAmount: whole XAF ≥ 0, ≤ the subtotal; deliveryFee: whole XAF ≥ 0, outside VAT, added to totalTtc; vatRate: the document's own rate (percent 0–100, 2 decimals; absent/null = the seller's); vatExempt: true = no VAT on the document (« Exonéré de TVA »); dueDate: yyyy-MM-dd, never before the issue date once issued. client gains rccm (≤ 50), email (≤ 255, valid), contactName (≤ 120), website (≤ 200); a line gains productId (catalogue product, optional, not checked) and reference (≤ 100). UPDATE_INVOICE replaces the whole content: a field left out is reset. Refused (REJECTED VALIDATION_ERROR): discount above the subtotal, rate outside 0–100, negative amounts, invalid email. Totals: see invoice-calculation-cases.json.",
